Translation-Photo Translate is a professional translation software that supports text translation, voice translation and photo translation, which can be conveniently used in all scenarios, both at work and in life, to help you use bilingualism smoothly.

Subscribe Related:
1.Users can only use photo translation, voice translation and other functions unlimited times after paying subscription;
2.Subscription will be deducted from the user's iTunes account upon confirmation of purchase, free trial for three days, renewable automatically, renewal fee $39.99/quarter;
3.Users can turn off auto-renewal 24 hours before the end of the current subscription, otherwise the subscription will be automatically renewed;
4. The Apple ID of the automatically renewed subscription will be automatically deducted from the iTunes account 24 hours before the expiration of each billing cycle and the corresponding validity period will be extended;
5. Users manage the subscription service, i.e., they can go to their user accounts to set off automatic subscriptions after purchase.

